##### 4.2.3.2 Residual background from \(\Delta\)

From both the \(\Theta^{++}\) and the \(\Lambda(1520)\) invariant mass plots in figure 4.2 and figure 4.3, we can see a peak at mass of 1.46-1.47 GeV/c\({}^{2}\). The offset of this peak

